length);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int[] arr = { 170, 45, -3, 75, 90, 802, 24, 2, -50, 66 };\n        sort(arr);\n        System.out.println(Arrays.toString(arr));\n    }\n}\n","numLines":68,"startLine":1,"totalLines":68}}}
